The bundled file tree is based on the Micro filemanager plugin
(https://github.com/micro-editor/updated-plugins), also MIT-licensed.

The Agent panel runs Herdr (https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr), Apache 2.0.
Pleach locates a local herdr binary or downloads the official release; it is
not a fork of Herdr. Color themes named after Herdr's built-in palettes
(Catppuccin, Tokyo Night, Nord, Rosé Pine, Kanagawa, Vesper, and others)
are independent Micro colorschemes using those public palettes.
